{"seq":2,"slug":"assessment-scoring-process","title":"评估与打分流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/assessment-scoring-process","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"评估与打分流程\">评估与打分流程</h1><p>技术雷达的信号质量取决于评估流程的严谨性。一个设计精美的象限+环结构如果装入的是未经验证的主观印象，那它比没有雷达更危险——因为它给了错误信号以权威包装。ThoughtWorks TAB（Technology Advisory Board）由 22 名全球高级技术顾问组成，每半年面对面讨论产出约 100 个 blip。大多数组织没有这种人才密度，因此需要设计一套在有限专家资源下仍能保证信号质量的评估流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>评估与打分流程的核心挑战是<strong>在有限的专家注意力预算下保证信号质量</strong>。本文构建一套从信号收集到终审定位的四阶段管道，包含五维度量化评分模型、证据强度分级体系、偏见对抗机制和校准会议流程，确保雷达产出的每一个环级定位都有可追溯的依据支撑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估管道的阶段划分\">评估管道的阶段划分</h2><p>从技术信号捕获到最终上雷达，整个流程分为四个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Collect[信号收集&lt;br/&gt;持续进行] --&gt; Screen[初筛&lt;br/&gt;月度]&#10;    Screen --&gt; Evaluate[深度评估&lt;br/&gt;季度]&#10;    Evaluate --&gt; Decide[集体决策&lt;br/&gt;半年度]&#10;    Decide --&gt; Publish[发布&lt;br/&gt;半年度]\">flowchart LR\n    Collect[信号收集&lt;br/&gt;持续进行] --&gt; Screen[初筛&lt;br/&gt;月度]\n    Screen --&gt; Evaluate[深度评估&lt;br/&gt;季度]\n    Evaluate --&gt; Decide[集体决策&lt;br/&gt;半年度]\n    Decide --&gt; Publish[发布&lt;br/&gt;半年度]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>参与者</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号收集</td>\n<td>全体工程师</td>\n<td>项目经验、会议洞察、文章论文</td>\n<td>候选 blip 池（backlog）</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初筛</td>\n<td>技术委员会代表（3-5 人轮值）</td>\n<td>候选池</td>\n<td>进入评估的短名单（20-30 项）</td>\n<td>2 小时/月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度评估</td>\n<td>领域专家（每项 2-3 人）</td>\n<td>短名单 + 评估模板</td>\n<td>结构化评估报告</td>\n<td>每项 4-8 工时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集体决策</td>\n<td>技术委员会全体</td>\n<td>评估报告</td>\n<td>环级定位 + 描述文本</td>\n<td>全天工作坊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"评估维度与评分模型\">评估维度与评分模型</h2><p>每个候选 blip 在深度评估阶段需要从五个维度进行结构化评估：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>评分标准（1-5）</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术成熟度</td>\n<td>0.20</td>\n<td>1=概念 / 2=原型 / 3=早期生产 / 4=广泛生产 / 5=行业标准</td>\n<td>社区活跃度、版本稳定性、生产案例数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组织适配性</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>与现有技术栈的兼容性 + 团队学习曲线</td>\n<td>架构评审 + 试点反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务价值潜力</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>对交付速度/质量/成本的预期改善</td>\n<td>业务 sponsor 访谈 + 量化估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险暴露</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td>安全、供应商、许可、合规风险的综合评估</td>\n<td>安全评审 + 许可审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态系统健康</td>\n<td>0.15</td>\n<td>社区规模、文档质量、第三方集成丰富度</td>\n<td>GitHub 指标 + Stack Overflow 活跃度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>综合得分计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>S</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum_{i=1}^{5} w_i \\cdot s_i, \\quad \\text{其中} \\quad S \\in [1, 5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>得分与环级的映射关系（参考阈值）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ring</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Adopt</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>S</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mtext> 且 </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Trial</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mn>3.0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4.0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Assess</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mn>2.0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3.0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Hold</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mtext> 或 </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>risk</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ring} = \\begin{cases}\n\\text{Adopt} &amp; \\text{if } S \\geq 4.0 \\text{ 且 } s_{\\text{risk}} \\leq 2 \\\\\n\\text{Trial} &amp; \\text{if } 3.0 \\leq S &lt; 4.0 \\\\\n\\text{Assess} &amp; \\text{if } 2.0 \\leq S &lt; 3.0 \\\\\n\\text{Hold} &amp; \\text{if } S &lt; 2.0 \\text{ 或 } s_{\\text{risk}} \\geq 4\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ring</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Adopt</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Trial</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Assess</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hold</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><blockquote>\n<p>注意：这些阈值是起点而非终局。集体决策阶段可以基于定性因素覆盖定量得分（override），但覆盖必须记录理由。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"证据强度分级\">证据强度分级</h2><p>评估质量的关键在于区分&quot;观点&quot;与&quot;证据&quot;。为每项评估的数据来源标注证据强度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>权重修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>E1</td>\n<td>组织内生产验证</td>\n<td>自有项目 6 个月以上生产运行数据</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2</td>\n<td>组织内试点验证</td>\n<td>内部 PoC / 试点项目（非生产）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3</td>\n<td>行业同行验证</td>\n<td>类似规模组织的公开案例研究</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4</td>\n<td>供应商/社区声明</td>\n<td>供应商白皮书、社区 benchmark</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E5</td>\n<td>专家直觉</td>\n<td>团队成员的经验判断（无量化数据）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个只有 E5 级证据支撑的高分评估应该自动降级——没有实证的热情是 Hype Cycle 的驱动力，不是技术战略的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏见对抗机制\">偏见对抗机制</h2><p>评估流程中最大的敌人是认知偏见。常见偏见及其对抗手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏见类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>对抗机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锚定效应</td>\n<td>第一个发言者的观点主导后续讨论</td>\n<td>匿名提交初始评分，然后揭晓讨论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沉没成本</td>\n<td>&quot;我们已经投了 6 个月&quot;导致不愿给 Hold</td>\n<td>评估表中显式隔离&quot;当前投资&quot;和&quot;未来价值&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>炒作追随</td>\n<td>&quot;Gartner 说这是趋势&quot;等于证据</td>\n<td>要求 E1-E3 级证据，分析师报告只算 E4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>否定偏见</td>\n<td>&quot;上次试了没成功&quot;永久否决重评</td>\n<td>每 2 年强制重评所有 Hold 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>群体思维</td>\n<td>委员会避免冲突趋向一致</td>\n<td>指定&quot;魔鬼代言人&quot;角色轮换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Anon[匿名独立评分] --&gt; Reveal[揭晓分数分布]&#10;    Reveal --&gt; Diverge{分歧度 &gt; 2分?}&#10;    Diverge --&gt;|是| Devil[魔鬼代言人辩论]&#10;    Devil --&gt; ReScore[重新评分]&#10;    Diverge --&gt;|否| Discuss[简短讨论确认]&#10;    ReScore --&gt; Final[取中位数为终分]&#10;    Discuss --&gt; Final\">flowchart TD\n    Anon[匿名独立评分] --&gt; Reveal[揭晓分数分布]\n    Reveal --&gt; Diverge{分歧度 &gt; 2分?}\n    Diverge --&gt;|是| Devil[魔鬼代言人辩论]\n    Devil --&gt; ReScore[重新评分]\n    Diverge --&gt;|否| Discuss[简短讨论确认]\n    ReScore --&gt; Final[取中位数为终分]\n    Discuss --&gt; Final</pre><h2 id=\"评估模板-单-blip\">评估模板（单 blip）</h2><p>实际操作中，每个候选 blip 需要填写的结构化评估文档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>内容要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>blip 名称</td>\n<td>明确无歧义的技术名称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>象限归属</td>\n<td>4 选 1 + 归属理由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前环级</td>\n<td>上一期位置（新 blip 填&quot;新增&quot;）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建议环级</td>\n<td>本期建议位置 + 移动方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一句话描述</td>\n<td>≤50 字的核心价值陈述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据列表</td>\n<td>每条标注 E1-E5 级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>五维评分</td>\n<td>各维度 1-5 分 + 简要理由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险声明</td>\n<td>采纳此技术的主要风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关 blip</td>\n<td>与哪些其他 blip 有关联（上下游/替代/互补）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估者</td>\n<td>主评人 + 同行评审人签名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与-gartner-hype-cycle-的互补使用\">与 Gartner Hype Cycle 的互补使用</h2><p>ThoughtWorks Radar 和 Gartner Hype Cycle 经常被混为一谈，但它们服务于完全不同的决策场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ThoughtWorks Radar</th>\n<th>Gartner Hype Cycle</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据来源</td>\n<td>一线项目的实战经验</td>\n<td>分析师调研 + 供应商访谈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐粒度</td>\n<td>具体技术/工具/实践</td>\n<td>技术类别/概念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间预测</td>\n<td>不做（聚焦&quot;现在该怎么做&quot;）</td>\n<td>预测到达主流的年限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>半年</td>\n<td>年度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>短期执行决策（下个季度用什么）</td>\n<td>中长期投资组合规划（3-5 年布局）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最有效的使用方式是将两者组合：Hype Cycle 提供 Horizon 2-3 的趋势信号输入（&quot;未来 3 年哪些技术可能成熟&quot;），Radar 处理 Horizon 1 的执行决策（&quot;现在哪些技术可以进入我们的工具箱&quot;）。这种组合与<a href=\"foundations/tech-strategy-frameworks\">技术战略框架</a>中三地平线模型的时间层完全对应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评分校准会议\">评分校准会议</h2><p>即使有量化评分模型，不同评估者之间的打分标准仍会漂移。每个评估周期开始前应进行一次<strong>校准会议</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>选取 3-5 个上一期的 blip 作为锚点案例</li>\n<li>全体评估者独立为锚点案例重新打分</li>\n<li>对比新分与原始分的偏差，识别系统性偏移</li>\n<li>讨论偏移原因，对齐评分标准的理解</li>\n<li>产出当期的&quot;评分参考手册&quot;（哪种情况给 3 分 vs 4 分）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个步骤的价值在于：让&quot;3.5 分意味着什么&quot;这个问题在评估开始前就有共识，而不是在分歧出现后才发现每个人的标尺不一样。校准的制度化保障来自<a href=\"radar-methodology/radar-governance-cadence\">雷达治理与节奏</a>中定义的会议节奏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>评估与打分流程的质量直接决定雷达的信号可信度。五维度评分提供量化可比的基础，证据强度分级防止热情替代实证，偏见对抗机制（匿名评分 + 魔鬼代言人）对抗群体思维，校准会议保证评分标尺的一致性。最核心的原则是：评分是决策的输入而非替代——集体决策阶段可以基于定性因素 override 定量得分，但每次 override 都必须记录理由、接受审视。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评估与打分流程","id":"评估与打分流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"评估管道的阶段划分","id":"评估管道的阶段划分"},{"level":2,"text":"评估维度与评分模型","id":"评估维度与评分模型"},{"level":2,"text":"证据强度分级","id":"证据强度分级"},{"level":2,"text":"偏见对抗机制","id":"偏见对抗机制"},{"level":2,"text":"评估模板（单 blip）","id":"评估模板-单-blip"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Gartner Hype Cycle 的互补使用","id":"与-gartner-hype-cycle-的互补使用"},{"level":2,"text":"评分校准会议","id":"评分校准会议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"象限与环的设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/radar-quadrants-rings"},"next":{"title":"雷达治理与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/radar-governance-cadence"}}